beyond the call of duty.

724
00:53:53.000 --> 00:53:56.000
You are three tiny, golden...

725
00:53:56.000 --> 00:53:59.000
...pill shaped
miracle workers,

726
00:53:59.000 --> 00:54:03.000
and you have stolen
not just England but my heart.

727
00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:06.000
Scarlet, over here!

728
00:54:07.000 --> 00:54:09.000
Pardon me?

729
00:54:10.000 --> 00:54:11.000
Eh?

730
00:54:11.000 --> 00:54:16.000
Wow! So many!
Good for you!

731
00:54:16.000 --> 00:54:18.000
Well, you'll all
get what you deserve.

732
00:54:19.000 --> 00:54:21.000
Serve!
...serve!

733
00:54:22.000 --> 00:54:24.000
Whoo-hoo!

734
00:54:47.000 --> 00:54:49.000
Oh.

735
00:54:51.000 --> 00:54:53.000
Go ahead, go ahead.

736
00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:56.000
Uh...

737
00:55:01.000 --> 00:55:03.000
Uh...

738
00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:07.000
I don't want you to take this
the wrong way, but I hate you.

739
00:55:07.000 --> 00:55:12.000
I thought I could get over what you did,
but I feel so betrayed.

740
00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:16.000
I think...
Yes, I think we're gonna have to break up.

741
00:55:16.000 --> 00:55:19.000
And it's not you.

742
00:55:19.000 --> 00:55:22.000
Wait, hold on.
It is you. It's 100% you!

743
00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:24.000
No, no.

744
00:55:24.000 --> 00:55:28.000
So get comfortable, Minions.
Get real, real comfortable.

745
00:55:28.000 --> 00:55:31.000
Because this is where
you're going to spend

746
00:55:31.000 --> 00:55:36.000
the rest of your
worthless little lives.

747
00:55:37.000 --> 00:55:40.000
All right!
Let's do this!

748
00:55:40.000 --> 00:55:42.000
Herb!

749
00:55:42.000 --> 00:55:44.000
Who's this handsome "Herb" fella?

750
00:55:44.000 --> 00:55:49.000
No, my name is "Blerb."
I'm a dungeon master.

751
00:55:49.000 --> 00:55:52.000
Prepare for torture,
which I do!

752
00:55:53.000 --> 00:55:58.000
All right, are we comfy?
Doesn't matter! This is torture!

753
00:56:01.000 --> 00:56:04.000
- Huh.
- Oh.

754
00:56:04.000 --> 00:56:07.000
Wow! Harder than I thought.
Next machine!

755
00:56:07.000 --> 00:56:12.000
Oh, welcome to Hang Town!
Population, you!

756
00:56:12.000 --> 00:56:15.000
Oh.

757
00:56:18.000 --> 00:56:19.000
Whoo-hoo!

758
00:56:19.000 --> 00:56:22.000
Cut it out! This is
really unprofessional!

759
00:56:22.000 --> 00:56:24.000
There's no laughing
in the dungeon!

760
00:56:24.000 --> 00:56:26.000
I wanna see tears and
I wanna hear screams,

761
00:56:26.000 --> 00:56:29.000
or I'm gonna get... Wait!

762
00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:31.000
Hey!
Ooh! I've got a groovy idea!

763
00:56:31.000 --> 00:56:33.000
Ah!

764
00:56:34.000 --> 00:56:37.000
Look at this!
Argh!

765
00:56:42.000 --> 00:56:45.000
Hello!
Will the future king, Herb Overkill,

766
00:56:45.000 --> 00:56:48.000
