more violent time.

788
00:58:04.000 --> 00:58:08.000
The material is a blend of taffeta
and high-density body armor.

789
00:58:08.000 --> 00:58:10.000
Fully armed and loaded.

790
00:58:10.000 --> 00:58:13.000
And that glow,
that's nuclear.

791
00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:15.000
Nice. Just one more
thing to do.

792
00:58:15.000 --> 00:58:17.000
Gotta look good for the public.

793
00:58:17.000 --> 00:58:19.000
Ugh.

794
00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:20.000
Do you mind?

795
00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:22.000
My pleasure.

796
00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:26.000
Little tighter, sweetie.
Come on, I can take it.

797
00:58:26.000 --> 00:58:28.000
Little tighter.

798
00:58:28.000 --> 00:58:30.000
Tighter!

799
00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:33.000
Must have tiny waist.

800
00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:36.000
Seeing stars, seeing stars!

801
00:58:36.000 --> 00:58:40.000
Losing feeling in my legs. Perfect!
Tie it, tie it, tie it, tie it.

802
00:58:42.000 --> 00:58:44.000
Huh?

803
00:58:44.000 --> 00:58:47.000
Ah. Bob! Stuart!

804
00:58:47.000 --> 00:58:49.000
Eh?

805
00:58:57.000 --> 00:59:00.000
- Ooh! Bello!
- Ooh-ooh!

806
00:59:01.000 --> 00:59:04.000
Ah! Oh.

807
00:59:04.000 --> 00:59:07.000
Ah.

808
00:59:09.000 --> 00:59:12.000
Huh!

809
00:59:17.000 --> 00:59:19.000
Ah.

810
00:59:21.000 --> 00:59:25.000
- Eh, eh, Kevin...
- ...Scarlet.

811
00:59:27.000 --> 00:59:29.000
Ah!

812
00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:34.000
"Porry Scarlet."

813
00:59:35.000 --> 00:59:38.000
- He, he!
- ...Boss.

814
00:59:39.000 --> 00:59:41.000
Oh.

815
00:59:42.000 --> 00:59:44.000
Ah, okay!

816
00:59:49.000 --> 00:59:51.000
Huh?

817
01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:05.000
I love you, Scarlet!

818
